<section class="nit nit-compare nit-section" aria-labelledby="nit-compare-heading">
  <div class="nit-container nit-compare__inner">
    <div class="nit-compare__head"><p class="nit-label nit-reveal">Comparison</p><h2 class="nit-h1 nit-compare__heading nit-reveal" id="nit-compare-heading">
        Against the alternatives
      </h2><div class="nit-body nit-muted nit-compare__intro nit-reveal">
          <p>The two things most people weigh this against. Figures are like for like, and two of these rows do not go our way.</p>
        </div></div><div
      class="nit-compare__scroll"
      role="region"
      tabindex="0"
      aria-label="Comparison table, scroll sideways to see every column"
    >
      <table class="nit-compare__table nit-nums">
        <caption class="nit-visually-hidden">Against the alternatives</caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <td class="nit-compare__corner"></td>
            <th class="nit-compare__col nit-compare__col--ours" scope="col">
              <span class="nit-compare__brand">Nitidus</span>
            </th>
            <th class="nit-compare__col" scope="col">&#163;15 handheld</th>
            <th class="nit-compare__col" scope="col">Forecourt vacuum</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody><tr >
              <th class="nit-compare__key nit-label" scope="row">Price</th>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell nit-compare__cell--ours">
                &#163;79 once
              </td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">&#163;15 once</td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">&#163;1 to &#163;2 per use</td>
            </tr><tr >
              <th class="nit-compare__key nit-label" scope="row">Suction</th>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell nit-compare__cell--ours is-lead">
                18,500 Pa
              </td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">About 2,000 Pa</td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">8,000 to 12,000 Pa</td>
            </tr><tr >
              <th class="nit-compare__key nit-label" scope="row">Runtime</th>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell nit-compare__cell--ours">
                32 minutes
              </td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">8 to 12 minutes</td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">Unlimited while paying</td>
            </tr><tr >
              <th class="nit-compare__key nit-label" scope="row">Filtration</th>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell nit-compare__cell--ours is-lead">
                HEPA, washable
              </td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">Foam pad</td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">None</td>
            </tr><tr >
              <th class="nit-compare__key nit-label" scope="row">Narrowest reach</th>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell nit-compare__cell--ours is-lead">
                19 mm
              </td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">35 mm</td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">38 mm hose</td>
            </tr><tr >
              <th class="nit-compare__key nit-label" scope="row">Where it works</th>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell nit-compare__cell--ours">
                Anywhere
              </td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">Anywhere</td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">At the forecourt</td>
            </tr><tr >
              <th class="nit-compare__key nit-label" scope="row">Ongoing cost</th>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell nit-compare__cell--ours is-lead">
                None
              </td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">Replacement filters</td>
              <td class="nit-compare__cell">Every single time</td>
            </tr></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="nit-label nit-compare__hint" aria-hidden="true">
      Scroll to compare
    </p><div class="nit-small nit-muted nit-compare__footnote">
        <p>A forecourt vacuum is cheaper today and never runs out of power. It is also only available at the forecourt. A &#163;15 handheld is the cheapest way to own one, and the reason most people buy a second.</p>
      </div></div>
</section>

